<div id="urduTextPath">شہزادی فاطمہ زہرا (ص)/بستر سے تھر تھرا کے اُٹھیں تھام کر عصا</div>
<p>bistar se tharthara ke uthi thaam kar asaa<br />
qabre nabi pa fateha-e- aaqri padha<br />
hamsaiyo'n ke ghar gayi ruqsat ko aur kaha<br />
lo sahebo behel karo ab kooch hai mera</p>

<p>eezaa thi tum sabho'n ko mere shor-o shain se<br />
kal fatima na hoyegi tum sona chain se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ham saaya ke huqooq se aagah hai jahaa'n<br />
logo mere yatimo'n se rehna nigah baa'n<br />
ab sath inka aur tumhara hai ham kaha'n<br />
bin maa ki hoti hai meri dukhyari betiya'n</p>

<p>bachpan pa apne bachho'n ke aansu bahati hu<br />
tum par hassan hussain ko mai chode jaati hu<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>rokar kabhi hassan ko gale se laga liya<br />
aaghosh me hussain ko gaahe bitha liya<br />
ruqsat kiya kisi ko, kisi ko bulaa liya<br />
padhne ke waaste kabhi quraa'n utha liya</p>

<p>kehti thi gaah bachho'n se mu apna modd ke<br />
kal soone ghar me sona hai basti ko chod ke<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sunlo waseeyate meri is waqt ya imaam<br />
fizza se mere baad adalat se lena kaam<br />
hushyar fatima ki amaanat se subh-o shaam<br />
do betiya'n do bete hai bas aur quda ka naam</p>

<p>mai ne bade dukho'n se ye sab bachhe paale hai<br />
haq ke hawaale tum ye tumhare hawale hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>sab hashmi qasam meri ismat ki khate hai<br />
mujh ko arab ki rasm se andeshe aate hai<br />
aurat ka murda taqth pa rakh kar uthaate hai<br />
aasaar is me murde ke sab paye jaate hai</p>

<p>deti hu main qasam tumhe rooh-e rasool ki<br />
waali na yu utthaiyo mayyat batool ki<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>hai aarzu ke qabr me mujh ko hassan litaaye<br />
shabbir mere laashe ka mu qibla roo phiraaye<br />
phir qud kaha, nahi nahi bachha hai dar na jaaye<br />
nagaah khelte huwe dono yateem aaye</p>

<p>chaati lagaa ke boli ke, lo ham toh marte hai<br />
tum se sulook dekhiye kya log karte hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>ye kehti thi ke ghash ne diya maut ka payaam<br />
hujre se nikle rote huwe aqroba tamaam<br />
tarteeb-e- naash ke liye baahar gaye imaam<br />
zehra ne yaa'n musalle pa apna kiya muqaam</p>

<p>likha hai bas namaaz ishaa ki adaa huwi<br />
aur ghul utha ke binte nabi ki qazaa huwi<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>maatha hassan ne laashe ke maathe pe rakh diya<br />
ro ro ke amma amma kaha aur ghash huwa<br />
talwo'n se apne maathe ko shabbir ne malaa<br />
paa'o me dam na paya, to ye kaan me kaha</p>

<p>mai aap ka ghulam hu aur noor-e ain hu<br />
aawaz do hussain hu, amma hussain hu<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>